<title>CANADA: Royal Bank Canada Q4 net rises 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank Canada Q4 net rises 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter ended Oct. 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.09		   C$0.90</p>
<p> Net			376,000		  320,000</p>
<p> Assets	     217,950,000	    183,652,000</p>
<p> Deposits	   161,817,000	    143,491,000</p>
<p> Loans		135,791,000	    119,577,000</p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$4.09		   C$3.49</p>
<p> Net		    1,430,000		1,262,000</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
